; Windows export list. R's share/make/winshlib.mk links against
; <dll base>-win.def when it exists, and otherwise generates one from `nm` over
; every object -- which for this package means the whole vendored engine, past
; the 65535 ordinals a PE export table can address.
;
; One entry is enough: NAMESPACE uses .registration = TRUE, and R_init_duckdb
; calls R_useDynamicSymbols(dll, FALSE) and R_forceSymbols(dll, TRUE), so R
; resolves every entry point through the routine table rather than by name.
;
; DuckDB's C API is exported regardless, by __declspec(dllexport) from
; DUCKDB_C_API (duckdb.h) and DUCKDB_EXTENSION_API (winapi.hpp); an export list
; cannot suppress those, and loaded extensions bind to them.
;
; The name of this file and the symbol below both carry the package name, so
; scripts/flavor.patch renames and rewrites them for a flavor.
EXPORTS
R_init_duckdb
